Section: 3. Related Work
Text: The effects of anchors on the interpretability of traditional topic models are often mixed (Lee & Mimno, 2014), but our experiments suggest that our approach yields more coherent topics. In health informatics, “anchor” features chosen based on domain knowledge have been used to guide statistical learning (Halpern et al., 2014).

